  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/306343/Spheres-Apocrypha-Swashbucklers?affiliate_id=549120\">Spheres Apocrypha: Swashbucklers</a></sup></p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Fencing sphere (Read Foe, Parry And Riposte) or Fencing sphere (Read Foe) and opportune parry and riposte deed, Scout sphere.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Whenever you scout a creature, the next parry and riposte you use against that creature does not cost martial focus, an attack of opportunity, or a panache point. When used in this way, the ability does not require you to have a panache point to perform an attack and you do not regain martial focus.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/practitioner-feats#toc104\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
